        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our main ridesharing competitor is Uber and our main competitors for app-based intermediation services for taxi and private hire vehicles are Uber and Bolt, though we also compete with other TNCs, taxi cab and livery companies as well as traditional automotive manufacturers and technology companies.",
        "start_character": 13118,
        "end_character": 13418
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since day one, we have worked continuously to enhance the safety of our platform and the ridesharing industry by developing products, policies and processes.",
        "start_character": 7434,
        "end_character": 7591
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To ensure our compensation remains competitive and fair, we regularly review our practices against external market data and make adjustments as needed to attract and retain top talent in a highly competitive labor market, particularly for highly skilled software engineers, product managers, and other technical professionals who are in high demand.",
        "start_character": 24260,
        "end_character": 24609
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also leverage our data science and algorithms to inform our product development.",
        "start_character": 10272,
        "end_character": 10355
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We organize our product teams with a full-stack development model, integrating product management, engineering, analytics, data science and design.",
        "start_character": 8191,
        "end_character": 8338
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we offer retirement savings programs, paid time off, parental leave, and other benefits designed to support our employees and their families.",
        "start_character": 24915,
        "end_character": 25070
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The more rides that are taken on our platform, the better we are able to offer riders personalized experiences most suitable to their trip.",
        "start_character": 6376,
        "end_character": 6515
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also compete with other manufacturers of bike and scooter sharing equipment for sales of such equipment, particularly in markets outside of the United States.",
        "start_character": 13527,
        "end_character": 13688
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are committed to helping our employees achieve their career goals through learning and development opportunities.",
        "start_character": 25348,
        "end_character": 25464
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that investing in our employees’ career development and maintaining high levels of engagement are essential to building and sustaining a high-performing workforce and a values-driven culture.",
        "start_character": 25107,
        "end_character": 25309
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We designed our platform with multiple layers of redundancy to guard against data loss and deliver high availability.",
        "start_character": 9063,
        "end_character": 9180
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-006960",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-006960-b253813ac7efb2b5",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-006960",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We designed the Lyft App with a focus on simplicity, efficiency and convenience.",
